<title>USA: Coca-Cola Enterprises sets $250 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Enterprises sets $250 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Coca-Cola Enterprises was priced on Friday, according to lead manager UBS Securities.</p>
<p>BORROWER COCA-COLA ENTERPRISES</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.95 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2026</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 98.085  FIRST PAY DATE 05/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.105 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS  SPREAD 63 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: U.S. TREASURY BOND DUE AUGUST 2026 U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
